<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.964" end="00:00:04.200" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.200" end="00:00:07.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In you go. In you go. Shut the door.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.200" end="00:00:07.700" style="s2">Let&#39;s have a good talk, just you and me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.860" end="00:00:09.880" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.800" end="00:00:17.900" style="s2">This time, your uncle is truly at his</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.700" end="00:00:20.300" style="s2">wit&#39;s end.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.900" end="00:00:22.100" style="s2">In all my life, I&#39;ve never begged</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.300" end="00:00:23.200" style="s2">anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.100" end="00:00:25.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Called it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.200" end="00:00:26.600" style="s2">I knew it would be like this. Uncle,</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.000" end="00:00:28.000" style="s2">crying won&#39;t help.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.600" end="00:00:30.785" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.000" end="00:00:32.805" style="s2">What do you need this time?</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.785" end="00:00:32.805" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.800" end="00:00:36.400" style="s2">You&#39;ll help me?</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.500" end="00:00:43.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOMMY!</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.265" end="00:00:43.800" style="s2">[screaming] MOMMY!</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.880" end="00:01:06.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.300" end="00:01:10.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re back. My baby&#39;s back. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.500" end="00:01:10.200" style="s2">mommy&#39;s fault. Mommy didn&#39;t watch you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.300" end="00:01:13.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s too beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.200" end="00:01:16.100" style="s2">So beautiful [music] that someone would</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.500" end="00:01:19.255" style="s2">want to steal her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.100" end="00:01:20.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we hide that beauty away.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.255" end="00:01:24.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.100" end="00:01:24.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat up. You&#39;ll need your strength.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.700" end="00:01:30.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.000" end="00:01:30.300" style="s2">I really can&#39;t eat anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.045" end="00:01:34.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.300" end="00:01:34.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.900" end="00:01:47.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know they mean well,</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.900" end="00:01:50.300" style="s2">but no one knows how much I hate</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.400" end="00:01:50.300" style="s2">the girl in the mirror.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.500" end="00:01:59.892" style="s2">Oops.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.600" end="00:01:59.892" style="s2">A wall blocking the whole hallway.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.792" end="00:02:07.092" style="s2">Hey, Bliff. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.992" end="00:02:08.492" style="s2">Tell me,</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.092" end="00:02:10.992" style="s2">how many people&#39;s worth of space do you</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.492" end="00:02:10.992" style="s2">take up?</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.492" end="00:02:14.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry. I&#39;ll go.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.966" end="00:02:14.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.692" end="00:02:22.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go. Give everyone a show. The</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.192" end="00:02:22.292" style="s2">blimp picking up her books. So funny.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.592" end="00:02:26.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You okay?</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.392" end="00:02:33.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dylan?</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.292" end="00:02:34.492" style="s2">Why are you bothering with her? She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.492" end="00:02:36.292" style="s2">just</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.492" end="00:02:37.492" style="s2">a little heavy.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.292" end="00:02:38.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw her kneeling here picking up her</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.492" end="00:02:41.292" style="s2">books.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.792" end="00:02:41.292" style="s2">Is that funny?</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.292" end="00:02:45.892" style="s2">Get up.</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.292" end="00:02:45.892" style="s2">Floor&#39;s cold.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.892" end="00:02:53.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.392" end="00:02:56.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next time someone messes [music] with</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.292" end="00:02:56.292" style="s2">you, tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.692" end="00:03:04.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He saved [music] me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.492" end="00:03:04.792" style="s2">I think I just fell for him.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.492" end="00:03:17.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same way. I&#39;m heading this way, too.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.847" end="00:03:19.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.092" end="00:03:19.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.992" end="00:03:25.392" style="s2">He remembers me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.492" end="00:03:25.392" style="s2">He actually remembers me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.892" end="00:03:31.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re too skinny. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.892" end="00:03:31.292" style="s2">Eat more.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.492" end="00:03:34.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not skinny.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.992" end="00:03:37.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To me, you&#39;re not.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.092" end="00:03:44.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cap, did the sun rise in the west today?</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.792" end="00:03:44.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. [music] Eat.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.392" end="00:03:51.792" style="s2">You okay?</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.692" end="00:03:54.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re [music] You&#39;re close.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.792" end="00:03:58.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. I&#39;ll walk you home.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.692" end="00:03:59.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These past few days, he&#39;s always there.</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.092" end="00:04:02.292" style="s2">The hallway, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.092" end="00:04:04.194" style="s2">the cafeteria, the walk home.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.292" end="00:04:07.794" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t say it,</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.194" end="00:04:07.794" style="s2">but he&#39;s always where I can see him.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.452" end="00:04:18.594" style="s2">[music] Tomorrow,</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.894" end="00:04:19.894" style="s2">I want to tell him</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.594" end="00:04:21.894" style="s2">just once.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.894" end="00:04:24.394" style="s2">I want him to know.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.894" end="00:04:26.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That dress, you&#39;ve never worn it once.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.394" end="00:04:27.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I was just tidying up.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.894" end="00:04:29.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma,</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.894" end="00:04:30.894" style="s2">that boy from the football team, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.594" end="00:04:32.594" style="s2">him, isn&#39;t [music] it?</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.894" end="00:04:34.694" style="s2">These few days, you&#39;ve smiled more than</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.594" end="00:04:36.794" style="s2">in the last 10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.694" end="00:04:40.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leo, he&#39;s the first person who treated</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.794" end="00:04:40.194" style="s2">me like a person in front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.894" end="00:04:43.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.894" end="00:04:45.594" style="s2">If anyone makes you sad, come home and</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.294" end="00:04:45.594" style="s2">tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.994" end="00:04:48.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This dress,</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.194" end="00:04:51.894" style="s2">it&#39;s beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.858" end="00:04:53.794" style="s2">[music] Mom, do you think I look pretty?</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.894" end="00:04:54.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beautiful, my Emma, the most beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.794" end="00:04:56.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never looked at the girl in the</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.694" end="00:04:57.894" style="s2">mirror as seriously as tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.494" end="00:04:59.494" style="s2">Tomorrow, I&#39;ll walk up to him in this</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.894" end="00:05:01.994" style="s2">dress and tell him</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.494" end="00:05:01.994" style="s2">I like him.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.578" end="00:05:07.094" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.194" end="00:05:09.818" style="s2">Dylan,</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.094" end="00:05:11.294" style="s2">I I have something to tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.818" end="00:05:12.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.294" end="00:05:14.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s up?</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.694" end="00:05:16.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These past few days,</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.494" end="00:05:17.694" style="s2">you kept helping [music] me. I I wanted</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.294" end="00:05:20.294" style="s2">to say</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.694" end="00:05:20.294" style="s2">I like you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.594" end="00:05:28.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, the wall is confessing. Everyone,</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.094" end="00:05:28.894" style="s2">come look.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.894" end="00:05:32.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you misunderstand something?</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.894" end="00:05:34.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.743" end="00:05:36.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.194" end="00:05:37.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That day I helped you, it was nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.194" end="00:05:38.894" style="s2">I&#39;d reach out for anyone kneeling there.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.694" end="00:05:40.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hear that [music] blowed? It meant</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.894" end="00:05:44.394" style="s2">nothing. Did you really think you were</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.594" end="00:05:44.394" style="s2">Cinderella? Take a look in the mirror.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.994" end="00:05:46.994" style="s2">So,</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.843" end="00:05:48.394" style="s2">[music] the only one who took it</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.994" end="00:05:50.794" style="s2">seriously</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.394" end="00:05:50.794" style="s2">was me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.894" end="00:05:56.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cap, three days, not a minute off. You</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.994" end="00:05:58.894" style="s2">owe us this round.</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.594" end="00:05:58.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.294" end="00:06:02.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where do you think you&#39;re going? Weren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.894" end="00:06:05.694" style="s2">you so brave just now? Where&#39;s all all</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.994" end="00:06:07.395" style="s2">courage? Give us another show.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.694" end="00:06:09.495" style="s2">Wrapped in a cover, hiding a love letter</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.395" end="00:06:11.995" style="s2">for our captain in there.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.495" end="00:06:16.195" style="s2">Please, just let me go. Let you go?</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.995" end="00:06:16.195" style="s2">Sure. Bark twice and I&#39;ll let you go.</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.695" end="00:06:30.195" style="s2">I said LET ME GO!</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.095" end="00:06:32.695" style="s2">OW! SHE SHOVED ME. SHE&#39;S TRYING TO hit</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.195" end="00:06:32.695" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.795" end="00:06:37.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.195" end="00:06:37.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t. She stepped back on her own.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.795" end="00:06:39.295" style="s2">It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.895" end="00:06:41.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw your hand go out.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.295" end="00:06:41.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.695" end="00:06:45.195" style="s2">He believes her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.395" end="00:06:48.295" style="s2">He didn&#39;t even ask.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.195" end="00:06:48.295" style="s2">He just believed her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.795" end="00:06:54.995" style="s2">Oops. The dress is [music] torn. How</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.195" end="00:06:58.095" style="s2">about another show, running home with</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.995" end="00:06:58.095" style="s2">your legs out?</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.789" end="00:07:05.995" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.695" end="00:07:07.719" style="s2">So this is what it feels like to be</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.995" end="00:07:08.495" style="s2">everyone&#39;s joke. It hurts so much.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.719" end="00:07:10.339" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.495" end="00:07:12.359" style="s2">I can&#39;t even cry out loud.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.339" end="00:07:12.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.995" end="00:07:25.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re too skinny. [music] Eat more.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.095" end="00:07:27.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They were all fake. The hallway was</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.995" end="00:07:30.995" style="s2">fake. The cafeteria [music] was fake.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.695" end="00:07:30.995" style="s2">That walk home was fake, too.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.995" end="00:07:38.695" style="s2">The girl in the mirror is me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.895" end="00:07:39.695" style="s2">The girl in the water is me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.695" end="00:07:41.295" style="s2">This fat, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.695" end="00:07:43.595" style="s2">this ugly.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.295" end="00:07:44.995" style="s2">No wonder no one really likes me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.595" end="00:07:47.995" style="s2">Even him.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.995" end="00:07:47.995" style="s2">It was just nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.225" end="00:07:56.245" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.295" end="00:08:04.995" style="s2">They&#39;re right. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.295" end="00:08:07.325" style="s2">I take up too much space. I said too</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.995" end="00:08:09.097" style="s2">much. Someone like me, why would anyone</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.325" end="00:08:11.397" style="s2">[music] like me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.097" end="00:08:13.597" style="s2">They say I take up too much space.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.397" end="00:08:15.097" style="s2">They say I&#39;m everyone&#39;s joke.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.597" end="00:08:16.797" style="s2">So,</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.097" end="00:08:20.297" style="s2">if I disappear,</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.797" end="00:08:20.297" style="s2">will everything finally be clean?</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.697" end="00:08:25.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This dress,</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.897" end="00:08:25.497" style="s2">it&#39;s beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.497" end="00:08:28.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.497" end="00:08:31.197" style="s2">If anyone makes you sad, come home and</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.897" end="00:08:31.197" style="s2">tell [music] me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.797" end="00:08:39.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, [music] mom. I&#39;m sorry, Leo.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.097" end="00:08:42.897" style="s2">I really</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.697" end="00:08:42.897" style="s2">can&#39;t hold on anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.697" end="00:09:19.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.996" end="00:09:24.297" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.397" end="00:09:26.697" style="s2">Where am I?</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.297" end="00:09:27.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma, you&#39;re awake. You scared us to</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.697" end="00:09:29.697" style="s2">death.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.797" end="00:09:32.197" style="s2">You fell into the lake. Someone pulled</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.697" end="00:09:35.497" style="s2">you out, called the ambulance, and left.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.197" end="00:09:35.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who saved [music] me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.026" end="00:09:40.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.297" end="00:09:42.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.697" end="00:09:43.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you apologizing? It&#39;s mommy&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.197" end="00:09:45.497" style="s2">fault. I scared you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.397" end="00:09:47.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s my fault. It&#39;s all my fault. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.497" end="00:09:50.997" style="s2">too fat. I&#39;m too ugly. That&#39;s why</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.297" end="00:09:52.797" style="s2">everyone I&#39;m just not good enough.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.997" end="00:09:54.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma, tell mommy what happened. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.797" end="00:09:57.297" style="s2">Did someone hurt you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.597" end="00:09:58.997" style="s2">Tell me and I&#39;ll go make it right.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.297" end="00:10:00.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one bullied me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.997" end="00:10:03.497" style="s2">It&#39;s my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.897" end="00:10:07.597" style="s2">I&#39;m too fat, too ugly.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.497" end="00:10:07.597" style="s2">Mom, I&#39;m not good. I &#39;m not good at all.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.697" end="00:10:13.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart, [music] lift your Look at</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.398" end="00:10:14.698" style="s2">daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.498" end="00:10:15.598" style="s2">It&#39;s your father and mother who failed</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.698" end="00:10:15.998" style="s2">to think things through.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.598" end="00:10:17.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad?</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.998" end="00:10:19.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever you want to do, we&#39;ll support</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.398" end="00:10:20.998" style="s2">you. [music] Starting today, go find</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.398" end="00:10:22.598" style="s2">yourself again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.998" end="00:10:26.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My baby.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.598" end="00:10:26.498" style="s2">My baby, mommy&#39;s so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.798" end="00:10:31.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma,</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.117" end="00:10:35.098" style="s2">[music] if you ever scare me like that</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.298" end="00:10:35.098" style="s2">again, I&#39;m never speaking to you again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.498" end="00:10:37.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.698" end="00:10:47.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These,</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.198" end="00:10:50.098" style="s2">I fed them to you because I was afraid</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.802" end="00:10:53.598" style="s2">[music] you&#39;d be taken. I thought</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.098" end="00:10:54.352" style="s2">if you were bigger, you&#39;d be safe.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.598" end="00:10:54.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom?</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.352" end="00:10:55.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.398" end="00:10:57.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My darling,</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.798" end="00:10:59.998" style="s2">starting today, you&#39;re going to find</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.198" end="00:10:59.998" style="s2">yourself again.</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.557" end="00:11:03.577" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.398" end="00:11:10.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good night, my girl.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.107" end="00:11:10.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.498" end="00:11:15.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not [music] pretty.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.998" end="00:11:18.698" style="s2">I&#39;m fat.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.498" end="00:11:22.298" style="s2">But daddy says I&#39;m the most beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.698" end="00:11:23.698" style="s2">Mommy says I should find myself again.</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.298" end="00:11:26.698" style="s2">Okay. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.698" end="00:11:26.698" style="s2">I&#39;ll go find myself.</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.398" end="00:11:36.598" style="s2">Starting [music] today,</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.798" end="00:11:40.198" style="s2">from today on,</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.598" end="00:11:40.198" style="s2">I&#39;m not going to be the wall anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.698" end="00:11:48.298" style="s2">Just one bite.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.498" end="00:11:50.498" style="s2">One bite should be</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.298" end="00:11:51.898" style="s2">fine, right? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.498" end="00:11:54.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no dessert before the main meal</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.898" end="00:11:54.598" style="s2">today, sis.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.298" end="00:11:58.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once I remember, I don&#39;t want it so</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.498" end="00:12:01.873" style="s2">badly anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.498" end="00:12:01.873" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My darling, you&#39;re doing great. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.498" end="00:12:15.399" style="s2">Don&#39;t look. It&#39;s not time [music] yet.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.099" end="00:12:22.199" style="s2">Sometimes I really want to quit. My legs</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.199" end="00:12:23.999" style="s2">feel like lead and my mouth has no taste</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.199" end="00:12:27.363" style="s2">at all. [music] But every time I think</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.999" end="00:12:29.383" style="s2">of that day, I find the strength again.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.363" end="00:12:29.383" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.948" end="00:12:34.199" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.999" end="00:12:37.199" style="s2">It really</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.199" end="00:12:37.199" style="s2">is a lot smaller.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.499" end="00:12:42.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma?</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.199" end="00:12:47.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do I [music] Do I look pretty in this?</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.699" end="00:12:53.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty. So pretty. That&#39;s my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.199" end="00:12:55.499" style="s2">My most beautiful daughter. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.799" end="00:12:57.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My baby.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.499" end="00:12:59.799" style="s2">How are you this beautiful?</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.899" end="00:13:02.599" style="s2">In all my life, I&#39;ve never seen a girl</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.799" end="00:13:02.599" style="s2">this beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.043" end="00:13:06.063" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.629" end="00:13:10.649" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.299" end="00:13:17.499" style="s2">This is me?</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.099" end="00:13:25.799" style="s2">I found it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.599" end="00:13:25.799" style="s2">I really found myself again.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.314" end="00:13:28.334" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.864" end="00:13:35.699" style="s2">[sighs] Today is the first day of</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.299" end="00:13:39.099" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.699" end="00:13:39.099" style="s2">Am I [music] ready?</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.799" end="00:13:44.399" style="s2">I&#39;m Emma.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.099" end="00:13:45.499" style="s2">I&#39;m still [music] Emma.</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.399" end="00:13:48.299" style="s2">It&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.499" end="00:13:49.894" style="s2">I finally found myself again.</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.299" end="00:13:51.199" style="s2">Be careful on the way. I &#39;ll pick you</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.894" end="00:13:52.999" style="s2">[music] up after school.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.199" end="00:13:55.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on. Let them all get a good look at</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.999" end="00:13:55.999" style="s2">what my sister looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.199" end="00:14:00.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m off. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.799" end="00:14:03.399" style="s2">From today on, I&#39;m the new Emma.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.399" end="00:14:04.899" style="s2">No one will ever bully me again.</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.399" end="00:14:07.399" style="s2">Don&#39;t look down.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.899" end="00:14:07.399" style="s2">Not today.</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.899" end="00:14:19.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I just</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.201" end="00:14:19.101" style="s2">hit into a ferry?</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.194" end="00:14:32.101" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.401" end="00:14:35.101" style="s2">The photo doesn&#39;t even do her justice.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.101" end="00:14:35.101" style="s2">That&#39;s just unfair.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.901" end="00:14:44.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So being looked at doesn&#39;t always mean</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.301" end="00:14:47.801" style="s2">being laughed at. So I can be looked at</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.921" end="00:14:47.801" style="s2">[music] like this too.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.155" end="00:14:52.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.201" end="00:15:00.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do I feel like</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.101" end="00:15:02.501" style="s2">she&#39;s glowing?</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.901" end="00:15:05.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the door.</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.501" end="00:15:08.101" style="s2">Last time I opened it, my head was down.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.220" end="00:15:08.101" style="s2">[music] Not this time.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.901" end="00:15:22.960" style="s2">They&#39;re all frozen.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.601" end="00:15:22.960" style="s2">It&#39;s okay. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.101" end="00:15:26.101" style="s2">I&#39;ll just keep walking.</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.800" end="00:15:30.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.801" end="00:15:33.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a transfer student, right? Or did</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.901" end="00:15:35.501" style="s2">you walk into the wrong class?</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.701" end="00:15:37.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not in the [music] wrong class.</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.501" end="00:15:37.901" style="s2">I&#39;m Emma.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.701" end="00:15:46.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say your name is? Emma?</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.701" end="00:15:46.401" style="s2">Which Emma?</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.501" end="00:15:51.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s sitting in Emma&#39;s [music] seat.</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.901" end="00:15:57.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re guessing who I am. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.201" end="00:16:01.001" style="s2">They&#39;ll never guess it. I am Emma, the</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.701" end="00:16:01.001" style="s2">blimp they call her every day.</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.550" end="00:16:03.701" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.301" end="00:16:05.901" style="s2">The old Emma would have pretended not to</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.701" end="00:16:09.101" style="s2">notice, then fidgeted all day. The new</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.901" end="00:16:09.101" style="s2">Emma won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.376" end="00:16:13.396" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.201" end="00:16:18.301" style="s2">He&#39;s still there, surrounded by everyone</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.501" end="00:16:19.702" style="s2">just [music] like before.</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.301" end="00:16:21.602" style="s2">The old me would have for half the day</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.702" end="00:16:23.166" style="s2">just from one glance. Now that I look</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.602" end="00:16:23.702" style="s2">again, he&#39;s really nothing special.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.166" end="00:16:25.102" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.702" end="00:16:26.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who cares who she is? She&#39;s prettier</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.102" end="00:16:29.602" style="s2">than Sienna. Put him side by side and</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.802" end="00:16:29.602" style="s2">Sienna&#39;s outshone.</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.576" end="00:16:39.596" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.902" end="00:16:43.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dylan?</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.202" end="00:16:43.902" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong? Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.502" end="00:16:51.502" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.802" end="00:16:57.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That seat.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.002" end="00:16:57.602" style="s2">Who&#39;s sitting there?</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.702" end="00:17:00.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is that?</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.902" end="00:17:07.902" style="s2">She knows I&#39;m here now. [music] Don&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.802" end="00:17:10.326" style="s2">afraid. You&#39;re no longer the Emma who</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.902" end="00:17:14.102" style="s2">knelt on the ground picking up books.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.326" end="00:17:14.102" style="s2">[music] I&#39;m going in to see who this is.</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.302" end="00:17:22.402" style="s2">What&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.502" end="00:17:22.402" style="s2">A transfer student?</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.202" end="00:17:30.402" style="s2">Hey, I&#39;m talking to you. Are you deaf?</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.302" end="00:17:35.402" style="s2">Before, when she spoke to me like this,</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.302" end="00:17:36.802" style="s2">I&#39;d lower my head, apologize, shrink</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.402" end="00:17:38.402" style="s2">into the corner.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.802" end="00:17:39.502" style="s2">Now [music] I just want to look at her</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.402" end="00:17:44.802" style="s2">and say,</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.502" end="00:17:44.802" style="s2">I am not afraid of you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.802" end="00:17:53.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sienna?</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.102" end="00:17:55.502" style="s2">She She&#39;s Emma.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.702" end="00:17:56.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You You&#39;re Emma?</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.502" end="00:17:59.202" style="s2">That</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.302" end="00:17:59.202" style="s2">That blip Emma?</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.762" end="00:18:02.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.702" end="00:18:08.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.902" end="00:18:10.502" style="s2">Emma?</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.402" end="00:18:13.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s trying to recognize me,</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.502" end="00:18:17.402" style="s2">but he&#39;ll never guess that this is me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.702" end="00:18:17.402" style="s2">The blip in his eyes is long gone.</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.902" end="00:18:20.803" style="s2">Why couldn&#39;t it be me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.903" end="00:18:27.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t that day I I didn&#39;t know it</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.203" end="00:18:28.003" style="s2">would</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.617" end="00:18:30.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.003" end="00:18:32.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He wants to explain? What is there to</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.003" end="00:18:33.603" style="s2">explain? When he shoved me down and</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.103" end="00:18:35.903" style="s2">rejected me in front of everyone, he</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.603" end="00:18:37.903" style="s2">wasn&#39;t stuttering then.</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.903" end="00:18:39.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That day it really was. I wanted to just</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.903" end="00:18:43.003" style="s2">hear me out.</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.503" end="00:18:43.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dylan, that&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.612" end="00:18:48.632" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.163" end="00:18:55.183" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.403" end="00:18:57.703" style="s2">Looks like your crown-wearing girl is</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.703" end="00:18:58.803" style="s2">mad.</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.703" end="00:19:00.368" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma, I</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.803" end="00:19:01.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you going to chase after her?</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.368" end="00:19:03.003" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.103" end="00:19:06.303" style="s2">Don&#39;t let me see you again.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.003" end="00:19:06.303" style="s2">The sight of you makes me sick.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.303" end="00:19:11.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sianna, Sianna, JUST LET ME EXPLAIN.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.403" end="00:19:14.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HUH.</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.468" end="00:19:16.903" style="s2">[music] So this is how it feels to make</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.903" end="00:19:18.403" style="s2">him run, to send him chasing after</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.903" end="00:19:19.363" style="s2">someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.403" end="00:19:22.303" style="s2">It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.363" end="00:19:22.303" style="s2">[music] nothing special.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.568" end="00:19:28.588" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.203" end="00:19:34.703" style="s2">He chased after her. He probably really</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.203" end="00:19:35.803" style="s2">didn&#39;t recognize me, but even if he did,</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.703" end="00:19:37.103" style="s2">so what?</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.803" end="00:19:39.503" style="s2">That few days of kindness was fake</p>
