<p begin="00:36:18.514" end="00:36:24.214" style="s2">lead. I must have her. So your uncle</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.414" end="00:36:24.214" style="s2">needs you to help me win her over.</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.314" end="00:36:26.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.514" end="00:36:37.214" style="s2">It&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.814" end="00:36:38.514" style="s2">Cole, in all my life, I&#39;ve never bowed</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.214" end="00:36:40.314" style="s2">my head to anyone. [music] Just this</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.514" end="00:36:41.914" style="s2">once, help your uncle.</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.314" end="00:36:43.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to win her over for you? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.914" end="00:36:47.816" style="s2">not an actor and I&#39;m not salesman.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.816" end="00:36:47.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, wait. Just hear me out.</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.916" end="00:36:51.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother passed early. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.316" end="00:36:53.016" style="s2">And your father, he never stops working.</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.816" end="00:36:55.616" style="s2">It was your uncle who raised you day</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.016" end="00:36:55.616" style="s2">after day.</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.816" end="00:36:58.016" style="s2">You can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.816" end="00:36:59.216" style="s2">You can&#39;t just stand there and watch</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.016" end="00:37:01.716" style="s2">your uncle&#39;s life&#39;s [music] work go down</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.216" end="00:37:01.716" style="s2">the drain.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.716" end="00:37:06.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been saying that ever [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.416" end="00:37:07.916" style="s2">since I was a kid.</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.116" end="00:37:11.316" style="s2">But this time it&#39;s real.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.916" end="00:37:13.116" style="s2">Your uncle is truly at his wit&#39;s end.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.316" end="00:37:14.516" style="s2">That role, I wrote it for 10 years. 10</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.116" end="00:37:15.616" style="s2">years. That girl in the photo is the one</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.516" end="00:37:17.216" style="s2">I&#39;ve been searching for, but she didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.616" end="00:37:19.116" style="s2">even spare me a glance before she ran</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.216" end="00:37:21.416" style="s2">off. Every time he used me as free child</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.116" end="00:37:21.416" style="s2">labor</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.316" end="00:37:25.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go talk to her.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.616" end="00:37:26.316" style="s2">But I can&#39;t promise anything.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.316" end="00:37:27.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.316" end="00:37:29.616" style="s2">You&#39;re going to help your uncle?</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.916" end="00:37:30.616" style="s2">Good nephew, I knew it. You have the</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.616" end="00:37:32.016" style="s2">softest heart.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.616" end="00:37:33.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s get one thing straight. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.016" end="00:37:36.316" style="s2">I&#39;ll only go talk to her. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.316" end="00:37:36.316" style="s2">guaranteeing anything.</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.016" end="00:37:41.716" style="s2">There it is.</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.916" end="00:37:41.716" style="s2">I&#39;ve been played again.</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.616" end="00:37:48.716" style="s2">One more thing. Let me give you a heads</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.816" end="00:37:51.716" style="s2">up. The male leader of this show, your</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.716" end="00:37:54.116" style="s2">uncle has decided is you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.716" end="00:37:54.841" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you I&#39;m not filming again.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.116" end="00:37:55.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COLE,</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.841" end="00:37:57.316" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.516" end="00:37:58.416" style="s2">YOU CAN&#39;T DO THIS TO ME.</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.316" end="00:38:00.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I HARDLY ASKED FOR ANYTHING.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.416" end="00:38:03.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FINE, FINE. Stop crying. Stop crying.</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.736" end="00:38:03.916" style="s2">[music] I truly am afraid of you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.666" end="00:38:07.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.316" end="00:38:09.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well then, your uncle will be waiting</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.016" end="00:38:09.816" style="s2">for your good news.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.316" end="00:38:16.216" style="s2">I really can&#39;t with him.</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.516" end="00:38:20.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smile, sweetie. Smile.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.016" end="00:38:21.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s why I never want to step into a</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.316" end="00:38:24.516" style="s2">studio again. Once I&#39;m in, it&#39;s [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.716" end="00:38:24.516" style="s2">all this mess.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.216" end="00:38:30.716" style="s2">I&#39;ve already found out where she lives.</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.116" end="00:38:30.716" style="s2">Have her won over before tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:38:31.916" end="00:38:36.161" style="s2">Win her over.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.516" end="00:38:36.161" style="s2">Easy for him to say. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.346" end="00:38:43.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.966" end="00:38:47.717" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.816" end="00:38:49.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes? Can I help you?</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.717" end="00:38:51.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello. My name [music] is Cole. Director</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.617" end="00:38:52.717" style="s2">Marcus sent me to talk with you about</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.117" end="00:38:54.446" style="s2">Emma starring in the film.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.717" end="00:38:55.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in, come in. Richard, we have a</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.446" end="00:38:56.617" style="s2">[music] guest.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.317" end="00:38:57.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;re the young man director Marcus</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.617" end="00:39:00.917" style="s2">sent to talk about Emma&#39;s film role.</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.917" end="00:39:00.917" style="s2">Come, come, sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.962" end="00:39:04.982" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.372" end="00:39:19.217" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.317" end="00:39:21.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.217" end="00:39:23.617" style="s2">Why are you in my house?</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.917" end="00:39:25.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re [music] back.</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.617" end="00:39:26.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every girl in school dreams of him even</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.317" end="00:39:27.917" style="s2">glancing her way</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.817" end="00:39:30.117" style="s2">and now he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.917" end="00:39:31.817" style="s2">sitting on my couch?</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.117" end="00:39:35.117" style="s2">What is happening?</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.817" end="00:39:35.117" style="s2">How does he even know where I live?</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.417" end="00:39:40.017" style="s2">What are you standing there for? Come</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.817" end="00:39:41.417" style="s2">over. This is Cole. The director sent</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.017" end="00:39:44.617" style="s2">him to talk about your film role. He</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.417" end="00:39:44.617" style="s2">came all the way to see you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.717" end="00:39:47.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.717" end="00:39:48.817" style="s2">see me? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.317" end="00:39:50.117" style="s2">I don&#39;t even know him.</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.817" end="00:39:51.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma,</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.117" end="00:39:52.717" style="s2">the director Marcus is the one filming</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.317" end="00:39:55.517" style="s2">that school movie.</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.717" end="00:39:55.517" style="s2">He wants you to play the lead.</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.017" end="00:39:58.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.217" end="00:40:00.317" style="s2">did you find my house?</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.917" end="00:40:01.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The director found [music] it. Once he</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.317" end="00:40:03.117" style="s2">sets his mind on someone, he finds a</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.717" end="00:40:04.017" style="s2">way.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.117" end="00:40:05.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.017" end="00:40:06.617" style="s2">you all came [music] to convince my</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.217" end="00:40:08.417" style="s2">parents for him?</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.617" end="00:40:10.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean convince? Cole came to</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.417" end="00:40:12.317" style="s2">discuss the film with us and we&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.117" end="00:40:13.117" style="s2">already said yes for you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.317" end="00:40:14.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.117" end="00:40:15.917" style="s2">agreed for me?</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.617" end="00:40:18.287" style="s2">Something this big and you never even</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.917" end="00:40:19.217" style="s2">asked me?</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.287" end="00:40:20.317" style="s2">[music] So much for respecting my</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.217" end="00:40:21.817" style="s2">choice.</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.317" end="00:40:24.117" style="s2">You two had it all planned. I was the</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.817" end="00:40:25.317" style="s2">only one left out. I I really don&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.117" end="00:40:27.117" style="s2">how to act.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.317" end="00:40:30.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody does at first.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.117" end="00:40:32.617" style="s2">You start filming and you&#39;ll learn.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.217" end="00:40:35.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the end. I dodged it for so long</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.617" end="00:40:35.817" style="s2">and I still can&#39;t get away.</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.017" end="00:40:42.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Starting tomorrow, the set is at school.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.417" end="00:40:44.417" style="s2">Just come over after class.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.317" end="00:40:45.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t agreed to anything yet.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.417" end="00:40:46.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetie,</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.517" end="00:40:49.318" style="s2">Cole came all the way here and that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.917" end="00:40:49.318" style="s2">how talk?</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.918" end="00:40:57.618" style="s2">He smiled.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.418" end="00:40:59.518" style="s2">The Cole who shows everyone a cold face</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.618" end="00:41:01.418" style="s2">actually smiled.</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.518" end="00:41:02.828" style="s2">What is he smiling at?</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.418" end="00:41:04.848" style="s2">What&#39;s so funny?</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.828" end="00:41:04.848" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.318" end="00:41:07.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See you tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.918" end="00:41:15.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t he supposed to be cold to</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.118" end="00:41:17.518" style="s2">everyone?</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.318" end="00:41:20.118" style="s2">Why would he smile at me?</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.518" end="00:41:23.418" style="s2">No. I need to get a grip. He&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.118" end="00:41:23.418" style="s2">running an errand for the director.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.118" end="00:41:32.718" style="s2">Just think of it [music] as</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.818" end="00:41:34.718" style="s2">an experience.</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.718" end="00:41:36.218" style="s2">It&#39;s only one film anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.718" end="00:41:37.918" style="s2">Did you hear? The lead actress for that</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.218" end="00:41:39.718" style="s2">film is decided. It&#39;s that girl from the</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.918" end="00:41:41.518" style="s2">confession wall. And the male lead is</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.718" end="00:41:43.118" style="s2">Cole. The campus heartthrob is actually</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.518" end="00:41:44.818" style="s2">going to be the leading man.</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.118" end="00:41:48.018" style="s2">Oh no. Now the whole school is [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.818" end="00:41:48.018" style="s2">going to know I&#39;m in that film.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.718" end="00:41:52.218" style="s2">I heard the [music] Queen Bee Sienna</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.718" end="00:41:53.218" style="s2">auditioned too but got re-necked. The</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.218" end="00:41:55.018" style="s2">director went and picked a total</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.218" end="00:41:58.018" style="s2">stranger. The heartthrob is her male</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.018" end="00:42:00.018" style="s2">lead. What&#39;s her deal?</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.018" end="00:42:02.518" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.018" end="00:42:02.518" style="s2">Her?</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.318" end="00:42:10.518" style="s2">Why? Her? That blub who never even dared</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.218" end="00:42:12.318" style="s2">to lift her head. How did she get to be</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.518" end="00:42:14.318" style="s2">the lead? Why was I rejected? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.318" end="00:42:16.518" style="s2">Sienna, maybe the director just likes</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.318" end="00:42:19.018" style="s2">that innocent innocent? What&#39;s innocent</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.518" end="00:42:20.718" style="s2">about her? She&#39;s just faking it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.018" end="00:42:22.618" style="s2">Sienna, [music] maybe we should go talk</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.718" end="00:42:24.518" style="s2">to the director.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.618" end="00:42:26.418" style="s2">Say what? That I&#39;m prettier than that</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.518" end="00:42:27.338" style="s2">fake innocent? If the director listened</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.418" end="00:42:29.358" style="s2">to advice, he wouldn&#39;t have picked her.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.338" end="00:42:29.358" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.018" end="00:42:40.118" style="s2">Sienna, I found out something. This film</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.218" end="00:42:42.018" style="s2">is shooting right here at our school.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.118" end="00:42:44.818" style="s2">Did you even need to ask around? Any</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.018" end="00:42:44.818" style="s2">fool could see that.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.018" end="00:42:49.918" style="s2">It&#39;s at school, so I&#39;ll have all the</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.718" end="00:42:52.018" style="s2">chances in the world.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.918" end="00:42:54.220" style="s2">Just you wait.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.018" end="00:42:56.620" style="s2">Sienna, what&#39;s your plan? Should [music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.220" end="00:42:57.920" style="s2">we make things hard for her?</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.620" end="00:42:59.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No rush.</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.920" end="00:43:01.120" style="s2">Filming gives us plenty of ways to make</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.520" end="00:43:02.420" style="s2">her look bad.</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.120" end="00:43:05.020" style="s2">Just wait and see.</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.420" end="00:43:07.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. There she is, our leading</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.020" end="00:43:10.520" style="s2">lady. Come, come. Let me introduce our</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.420" end="00:43:10.520" style="s2">male lead, Cole.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.484" end="00:43:16.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.620" end="00:43:22.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We meet again.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.035" end="00:43:25.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.999" end="00:43:25.019" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.320" end="00:43:30.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He actually smiled at her. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.420" end="00:43:34.120" style="s2">He&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.920" end="00:43:34.120" style="s2">Nobody takes him from me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.020" end="00:43:39.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be nervous. [music] Just walk and</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.420" end="00:43:39.420" style="s2">talk the way you always do.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.520" end="00:43:42.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.520" end="00:43:43.620" style="s2">I can&#39;t act well and waste everyone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.220" end="00:43:44.820" style="s2">time?</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.620" end="00:43:46.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you mess up, we just shoot another</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.820" end="00:43:47.920" style="s2">take. What&#39;s to fear? Your director has</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.420" end="00:43:49.120" style="s2">all the patience in the world.</p>
