<p begin="01:04:57.633" end="01:04:59.933" style="s2">real.</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.733" end="01:05:06.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.809" end="01:05:09.633" style="s2">[music] does that girlfriend thing from</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.833" end="01:05:09.633" style="s2">earlier still count?</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.833" end="01:05:13.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It counts.</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.980" end="01:05:19.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.533" end="01:05:23.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough, ENOUGH. THAT&#39;S A WRAP FOR TODAY.</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.835" end="01:05:23.535" style="s2">CELEBRATION DINNER TONIGHT.</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.835" end="01:05:29.235" style="s2">I HEREBY DECLARE THE HIDDEN BEAUTY.</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.535" end="01:05:29.235" style="s2">THAT&#39;S A WRAP.</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.935" end="01:05:36.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a wrap. Thank you for being my</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.735" end="01:05:37.935" style="s2">leading lady.</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.635" end="01:05:39.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re welcome.</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.935" end="01:05:42.235" style="s2">And you&#39;ve been my leading man for a</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.235" end="01:05:42.235" style="s2">very long time.</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.035" end="01:05:51.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once the trailer goes out, the whole</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.135" end="01:05:54.335" style="s2">North American campus is going to</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.635" end="01:05:54.335" style="s2">explode.</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.035" end="01:06:18.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A year [music] ago,</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.435" end="01:06:20.135" style="s2">they wouldn&#39;t even look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.835" end="01:06:21.735" style="s2">Now,</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.135" end="01:06:24.135" style="s2">even the security guard has to keep</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.735" end="01:06:24.135" style="s2">order.</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.651" end="01:06:32.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.935" end="01:06:34.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One at a time, everyone. Don&#39;t push.</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.135" end="01:06:36.435" style="s2">She&#39;ll sign for all of you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:34.135" end="01:06:38.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before, when people crowded around me,</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.435" end="01:06:39.435" style="s2">it was to bully me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.135" end="01:06:40.935" style="s2">Now they crowd around me because they</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.435" end="01:06:42.135" style="s2">like me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.935" end="01:06:44.235" style="s2">And</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.135" end="01:06:45.435" style="s2">there&#39;s him at my back now.</p>
<p begin="01:06:44.235" end="01:06:46.935" style="s2">It feels</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.435" end="01:06:47.935" style="s2">like a dream.</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.935" end="01:06:50.935" style="s2">Yesterday I [music] was Emma the</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.935" end="01:06:52.935" style="s2">Invisible. Today I&#39;m a star.</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.935" end="01:06:53.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t become a star.</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.935" end="01:06:56.335" style="s2">You were always [music] meant to stand</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.935" end="01:06:56.335" style="s2">in the light.</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.435" end="01:07:01.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what do we do from now on?</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.135" end="01:07:04.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll worry about that later. Drink your</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.835" end="01:07:04.635" style="s2">bubble tea first.</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.935" end="01:07:17.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t come [snorts] back to this house</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.935" end="01:07:19.835" style="s2">for a while.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.635" end="01:07:22.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 months. Dad won&#39;t acknowledge me. Mom</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.835" end="01:07:23.836" style="s2">doesn&#39;t dare visit. I&#39;m like a stray dog</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.035" end="01:07:26.336" style="s2">thrown out the street.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.836" end="01:07:28.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sienna, stop thinking about it. Stick</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.336" end="01:07:29.536" style="s2">with us. You&#39;ll have food and booze.</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.336" end="01:07:32.036" style="s2">Ain&#39;t that better than that lousy school</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.536" end="01:07:32.036" style="s2">of yours? now.</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.976" end="01:07:46.996" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.736" end="01:07:53.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s smiling.</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.136" end="01:07:56.236" style="s2">She actually looks so happy. The cheers,</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.736" end="01:07:58.236" style="s2">the cameras, that male lead, all of it</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.236" end="01:08:00.136" style="s2">was supposed to be mine.</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.236" end="01:08:03.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma, I love you and Cole so much. You</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.136" end="01:08:03.236" style="s2">guys must be happy.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.592" end="01:08:08.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.736" end="01:08:12.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Happy?</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.236" end="01:08:14.336" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.536" end="01:08:17.136" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll smash it all</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.336" end="01:08:21.136" style="s2">piece by piece.</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.136" end="01:08:21.136" style="s2">Ach, I need you to do something for me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.636" end="01:08:26.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it? As long as the money&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.136" end="01:08:26.936" style="s2">right, I&#39;ll do anything.</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.436" end="01:08:31.836" style="s2">Got it. Just say the word.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.636" end="01:08:36.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma, you took everything [music] from</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.636" end="01:08:38.636" style="s2">me. I&#39;m going to make you pay with your</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.536" end="01:08:40.336" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.636" end="01:08:43.236" style="s2">All of you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.336" end="01:08:43.236" style="s2">Just you wait.</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.736" end="01:08:47.936" style="s2">Tomorrow afternoon, [music]</p>
<p begin="01:08:45.836" end="01:08:50.736" style="s2">find a way to keep Cole occupied. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.936" end="01:08:53.436" style="s2">let him get to school.</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.736" end="01:08:55.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep the big star busy. Easy. I&#39;ll call</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.436" end="01:08:56.536" style="s2">up a few more guys. We&#39;ll take real good</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.036" end="01:08:58.536" style="s2">care of them.</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.536" end="01:09:01.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you screw [music] this up,</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.536" end="01:09:03.036" style="s2">you know what happens.</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.136" end="01:09:05.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you worry. Have I ever dropped the</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.036" end="01:09:05.336" style="s2">ball?</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.817" end="01:09:10.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:09:09.336" end="01:09:12.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Emma,</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.236" end="01:09:15.636" style="s2">after today, let&#39;s see how you use that</p>
<p begin="01:09:12.336" end="01:09:15.636" style="s2">face to stand in the light.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.236" end="01:09:23.736" style="s2">Something about [music] Cole</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.736" end="01:09:25.236" style="s2">and about that year I fell in the water.</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.736" end="01:09:26.737" style="s2">How does she know?</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.236" end="01:09:28.538" style="s2">Should I tell Cole?</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.737" end="01:09:31.338" style="s2">No, [music] if this is a trap, I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.538" end="01:09:31.338" style="s2">drag him into it.</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.018" end="01:09:38.938" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.737" end="01:09:38.938" style="s2">Yeah, see you after school.</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.737" end="01:09:46.237" style="s2">Sienna?</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.338" end="01:09:51.338" style="s2">What did you really call me here to say?</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.637" end="01:09:53.438" style="s2">You know what?</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.338" end="01:09:55.238" style="s2">The day I got expelled, as I carried my</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.438" end="01:09:56.637" style="s2">box out those gates, I figured it all</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.238" end="01:09:58.838" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.637" end="01:10:00.438" style="s2">Everything I lost,</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.838" end="01:10:03.538" style="s2">I&#39;m going to take it all back from you</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.438" end="01:10:03.538" style="s2">piece by piece.</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.137" end="01:10:09.338" style="s2">I told [music] you,</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.738" end="01:10:12.438" style="s2">you took everything from me.</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.338" end="01:10:12.438" style="s2">Now you pay the price.</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.838" end="01:10:16.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sienna, calm down. Doing this will only</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.538" end="01:10:18.238" style="s2">destroy you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.938" end="01:10:20.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Destroyed?</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.238" end="01:10:23.538" style="s2">I&#39;m already destroyed</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.038" end="01:10:23.538" style="s2">by the two of you together.</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.137" end="01:10:29.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re insane. You&#39;ve truly lost your</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.438" end="01:10:31.438" style="s2">mind.</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.438" end="01:10:33.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I&#39;m insane. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.438" end="01:10:35.279" style="s2">I&#39;ve been insane since the day you took</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.238" end="01:10:37.238" style="s2">everything from me.</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.279" end="01:10:39.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.238" end="01:10:41.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t let you hurt me anymore. Not</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.038" end="01:10:41.637" style="s2">ever again.</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.538" end="01:10:48.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare fight back?</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.438" end="01:10:50.538" style="s2">Weren&#39;t you the one who used to just</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.637" end="01:10:51.938" style="s2">lower her [music] head and cry? That was</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.538" end="01:10:53.137" style="s2">the old me.</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.938" end="01:10:55.838" style="s2">Now</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.137" end="01:10:55.838" style="s2">I&#39;m different.</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.738" end="01:11:04.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. [music] Very well, then we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.938" end="01:11:04.938" style="s2">do this another way.</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.538" end="01:11:13.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t fall. I absolutely cannot fall.</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.538" end="01:11:15.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, Emma,</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.738" end="01:11:16.738" style="s2">this time [music] is it still you</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.438" end="01:11:20.238" style="s2">standing in the light?</p>
<p begin="01:11:16.738" end="01:11:20.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sienna, don&#39;t. Please.</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.838" end="01:11:24.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yo, big star, where&#39;s the hurry? [music]</p>
<p begin="01:11:22.938" end="01:11:26.938" style="s2">Come hang with us for a drink.</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.637" end="01:11:26.938" style="s2">Move.</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.239" end="01:11:33.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who sent you?</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.139" end="01:11:35.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t don&#39;t hit me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.439" end="01:11:37.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was Siana. Siana told me to keep you</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.239" end="01:11:39.739" style="s2">here. She she&#39;s gone after that girl.</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.339" end="01:11:41.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.739" end="01:11:44.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The the school rooftop. She lured her up</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.839" end="01:11:44.539" style="s2">to the rooftop.</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.739" end="01:11:53.539" style="s2">Emma, wait for me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.739" end="01:11:53.539" style="s2">Please wait for me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.394" end="01:12:04.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.669" end="01:12:07.689" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.839" end="01:12:13.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pull me up. Pull me up. I DON&#39;T WANT TO</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.839" end="01:12:13.139" style="s2">DIE. I DON&#39;T WANT TO DIE.</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.139" end="01:12:20.239" style="s2">I&#39;M PULLING.</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.539" end="01:12:20.239" style="s2">I&#39;M PULLING.</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.389" end="01:12:24.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.739" end="01:12:24.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; EMMA!</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.939" end="01:12:27.039" style="s2">EMMA!</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.180" end="01:12:37.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.839" end="01:12:37.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HOLD ON TO ME. DON&#39;T LET GO.</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.939" end="01:12:43.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HELP HELP ME.</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.939" end="01:12:43.139" style="s2">PULL me up, please.</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.639" end="01:12:50.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.639" end="01:12:51.739" style="s2">It&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.739" end="01:12:52.839" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.739" end="01:12:56.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.839" end="01:12:56.039" style="s2">I thought I was going to fall.</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.039" end="01:13:02.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We got a report of an assault with</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.035" end="01:13:02.939" style="s2">[music] a weapon at this location.</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.739" end="01:13:13.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hate you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.539" end="01:13:13.739" style="s2">I hate all of you.</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.939" end="01:13:21.139" style="s2">She</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.339" end="01:13:22.939" style="s2">what&#39;s going to happen to her?</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.139" end="01:13:24.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s for the police to decide.</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.939" end="01:13:25.580" style="s2">Not your problem.</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.839" end="01:13:27.239" style="s2">Does it hurt?</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.580" end="01:13:29.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.239" end="01:13:29.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.340" end="01:13:40.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you know I was [music] up here?</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.540" end="01:13:43.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone tried to stop me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.140" end="01:13:44.340" style="s2">So I knew something was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.140" end="01:13:46.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank [music] you</p>
<p begin="01:13:44.340" end="01:13:47.440" style="s2">for saving me again.</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.140" end="01:13:49.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go with you to the graduation</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.440" end="01:13:49.940" style="s2">ceremony.</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.711" end="01:14:00.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.540" end="01:14:01.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That day feels like a long time ago.</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.340" end="01:14:04.940" style="s2">And yet</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.740" end="01:14:06.740" style="s2">like it was just yesterday.</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.940" end="01:14:08.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that her? Look at [music] our girl</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.740" end="01:14:11.540" style="s2">standing so tall.</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.140" end="01:14:11.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look up. Smile.</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.740" end="01:14:24.140" style="s2">That film did our school proud.</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.151" end="01:14:29.171" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.440" end="01:14:34.540" style="s2">These two kids</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.040" end="01:14:37.940" style="s2">from filming to graduation, they never</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.540" end="01:14:37.940" style="s2">missed a step. That&#39;s wonderful.</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.540" end="01:14:41.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We graduated.</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.740" end="01:14:45.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.340" end="01:14:48.640" style="s2">We did.</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.040" end="01:14:48.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 2 1</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.040" end="01:14:55.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for saving me so many times.</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.740" end="01:14:58.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, [music] it&#39;s your turn to</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.540" end="01:14:58.040" style="s2">save me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.340" end="01:15:01.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.240" end="01:15:04.440" style="s2">It&#39;s settled.</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.240" end="01:15:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, sweetheart. Mom is so</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.440" end="01:15:07.440" style="s2">proud of you.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
